    "Header-only vendoring: upstream include/ tree only (no compiled sources exist upstream).",
    "Excluded from the vendored tree: include/ableton/test/, include/ableton/util/test/, include/ableton/discovery/test/ (test-only headers), include/CMakeLists.txt (build file).",
    "include/ableton/link_audio/ and LinkAudio.hpp/.ipp are vendored for completeness but unused: the app includes only <ableton/Link.hpp> (receiver-only client, no Link Audio).",
    "Build requirements (from upstream cmake_include/ and README \"Other Build Systems\"): include paths ableton_link/include + asio include dir; defines LINK_PLATFORM_LINUX=1 (Linux/Android/PortMaster), LINK_PLATFORM_MACOSX=1 (macOS), LINK_PLATFORM_WINDOWS=1 + INCL_EXTRA_HTON_FUNCTIONS=1 + _WIN32_WINNT=0x0601 (Windows); ASIO_STANDALONE=1, ASIO_NO_TYPEID=1, ASIO_VERSION_NAMESPACE=link_asio_1_38_2 on all platforms; GCC needs -Wno-multichar (4-char literals in ~10 headers); link libs -latomic -lpthread (Linux), -latomic (Android)."
